@startuml
skinparam roundcorner 8
autonumber

actor "Client Web (Next.js)" as Client
participant "FastAPI WS Endpoint\n(/ws/market)" as Endpoint
participant "LiveMarketService\n(Singleton)" as Service
participant "asyncio.Queue\n(Queue client)" as Queue
cloud "Twelve Data WS\n(wss://ws.twelvedata.com)" as TD_WS

== Initialisation de l'application ==
Service -> TD_WS: Connexion WebSocket & Authentification (API Key)
TD_WS --> Service: 101 Switching Protocols & Status OK
Service -> TD_WS: Souscription symbole "XAU/USD"

== Connexion d'un Client Frontend ==
Client -> Endpoint: Requête Upgrade WebSocket (/ws/market)
Endpoint -> Endpoint: ws.accept()
Endpoint -> Service: add_subscriber()
Service -> Queue: Créer asyncio.Queue(maxsize=100)
Service -> Queue: Injecter le dernier tick en cache (type: initial_state)
Service --> Endpoint: Référence Queue
Endpoint -> Queue: queue.get()
Queue --> Endpoint: Tick initial
Endpoint -> Client: Envoi JSON (initial_state)

== Diffusion en Continu des Ticks ==
TD_WS -> Service: Message tick JSON ("event": "price", "price": 2705.50, "timestamp": ...)
Service -> Service: Normaliser horodatage & valider symbole
Service -> Service: Mettre à jour _latest_ticks["XAU/USD"]
loop Pour chaque Queue active
    Service -> Queue: put_nowait(tick_normalisé)
end

Endpoint -> Queue: queue.get()
Queue --> Endpoint: Tick reçu
Endpoint -> Client: ws.send_json(tick)

== Déconnexion ==
Client -> Endpoint: Fermeture connexion (WebSocketDisconnect)
Endpoint -> Service: remove_subscriber(queue)
Service -> Service: Supprimer queue de _subscriber_queues

@enduml

